----                             3472  ; The emit* helpers encode the same little-endian jump-target format produced by  ; [section data]
----                             3473  ; Rust's default_family_tokenizer_vm_program_bytes(). Keep demoProgram and the  ; [section data]
----                             3474  ; DEMO_PC_* offsets together so the control-flow map stays readable.  ; [section data]
----                             3475    ; [section data]
----                             3476    ; [section data]
